{
  "title": "ProdOps Runtime — Event Counters v2",
  "description": "EXP-015 | Sub-quadros por fase: Plan Bootstrap → CI Sync (Bootstrap/Hack/Sync/Finish) → CI Async (Ship/Validate) → Promote → Diligence. Filtre por $issue para isolar uma feature.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "tags": [
    "team:prodops"
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "payments-api"
    },
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "development"
    },
    {
      "name": "issue",
      "prefix": "issue",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## ProdOps Runtime — Event Counters\n### EXP-015  |  Plan Bootstrap → CI Sync → CI Async → Promote → Diligence\n\nCada widget conta quantas vezes o evento foi recebido no período selecionado.\nFiltre por `$issue` para isolar uma feature.\n\nMétricas: `runtime.event.received` (Delivery) · `runtime.diligence.event.received` (Diligence)",
        "background_color": "vivid_blue",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "center",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**PLAN BOOTSTRAP** — executa uma única vez por iteração | `subject: iteration-id` | `runtime.event.received`",
        "background_color": "vivid_blue",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "center",
        "vertical_align": "center",
        "show_tick": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Started",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoscale": true,
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:runtime.event.received{event:prodops.delivery.plan.bootstrap.started,service:$service.value,env:$env.value}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 0,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
